Batch Availability
Chicks will be sold on a first-come-first-serve basis on CHICK DAY 
Please note chick availability may change. Please check for updates after 6 PM a day before chick day. We do not have control over the breeds and amount of chicks we receive, but the hatchery has assured us that they are doing their best to fulfill orders.

